      "content": "it sounds like a lot of money just to comply with some rules. i mean, if we can't afford the upgrades, we might have to shut down. isn't it a bit much to be pushing these expensive mandates on small shops that are already struggling? it feels like they're just prioritizing environmental goals over the survival of local businesses.",
