      "content": "but those credits and \"efficiencies\" you mentioned don't really help if the baseline cost of doing business just goes up across the board. it feels like the people writing these rules don't actually get how much this hurts the little guy. honestly, if you look at the actual math, these mandates seem more like an attack on small industry than a way to actually save the planet. don't you think the economic damage to local manufacturing is being totally ignored in favor of these green targets?",
